---
// Small "ADV" pill for notes with tier: advanced (harder, or leans on several earlier notes).
---

<span class="adv" title="Advanced: read after the core notes of this section." aria-label="Advanced">ADV</span>

<style>
  .adv {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    flex: none;
    padding: 1px 5px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
    border-radius: 4px;
    font: 600 0.5625rem/1.4 var(--font-mono);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--text-faint);
    vertical-align: middle;
    cursor: help;
  }
</style>
